                    {
                        "type": 1,
                        "content": {
                            "json": "### App Service Certificates Inventory (`microsoft.web/certificates`)\r\nAll custom and managed SSL certificates uploaded to App Services across your subscriptions. Use the **Expiry Filter** above to isolate critical or expired certificates."
