                    {
                        "type": 1,
                        "content": {
                            "json": "#### How to Display Expiration Dates for Application Gateway Certificates\n\nAzure Application Gateway stores directly uploaded certificates as raw Base64 data (`publicCertData`) without exposing an explicit `expirationDate` property in Azure Resource Manager (ARM).\n\nTo decode and display their **exact expiration date, days remaining, and expiry status**:\n\n1. **Option 1: Tag Application Gateways (Recommended - Displays Directly in Table Above)**\n   Run the helper script with the `-UpdateGatewayTags` switch. It decodes the Base64 X.509 certificate and writes the expiration date and days remaining as tags on your Application Gateways. Azure Resource Graph displays them natively in the table above:\n   ```powershell\n   powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\\scripts\\Sync-AppGatewayCertificatesToLogAnalytics.ps1 -UpdateGatewayTags\n   ```\n\n2. **Option 2: Log Analytics Ingestion (Historical Decoded Compliance View)**\n   Run the script to ingest decoded certificate telemetry into Log Analytics:\n   ```powershell\n   powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\\scripts\\Sync-AppGatewayCertificatesToLogAnalytics.ps1 -AutoDiscoverWorkspace\n   ```\n   Then switch the view pill above to **Log Analytics Historical Decoded Table** to view historical audit records.",
                            "style": "info"
                        },
                        "name": "text - App Gateway Sync Guidance"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": 3,
                        "content": {
                            "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
                            "query": "AppGatewayCertificates_CL\r\n| extend DaysRemaining = toint(DaysRemaining_d)\r\n| extend ExactExpirationDateTime = todatetime(NotAfter_s)\r\n| extend ExactExpirationUTC = tostring(NotAfter_s)\r\n| extend ExpiryGroup = case(\r\n    DaysRemaining < 0, 'Expired',\r\n    DaysRemaining <= 30, 'Critical',\r\n    DaysRemaining <= 60, 'Warning',\r\n    DaysRemaining <= 90, 'Attention',\r\n    'Healthy'\r\n)\r\n| where '{ExpiryThreshold}' == 'all' or ExpiryGroup == '{ExpiryThreshold}'\r\n| project \r\n    AppGateway = AppGatewayName_s,\r\n    Certificate = CertificateName_s,\r\n    CertificateSource = CertificateSource_s,\r\n    ExactExpirationDateTime,\r\n    ExactExpirationUTC,\r\n    DaysRemaining,\r\n    ExpiryStatus = ExpiryStatus_s,\r\n    Subject = Subject_s,\r\n    Thumbprint = Thumbprint_s,\r\n    ResourceGroup = ResourceGroup_s,\r\n    Subscription = SubscriptionId_s\r\n| sort by DaysRemaining asc",
                            "size": 2,
                            "title": "Decoded Certificates - Exact Expiration Date & Time (Log Analytics)",
                            "noDataMessage": "No decoded certificate records found in Log Analytics yet. Run scripts/Sync-AppGatewayCertificatesToLogAnalytics.ps1 to populate this table.",
                            "showExportToExcel": true,
